# Week 4 - Power BI Marketing Attribution Dashboard

## Objective

Designed an interactive Power BI dashboard to analyze marketing performance using attribution data.

## Dashboard KPIs

- Total Revenue
- Total Spend
- Total Clicks
- Total Impressions
- Total Conversions
- Average ROAS
- Average CAC

## Dataset

- Records: 5,000
- Source: Marketing Attribution Dataset
- Database: MySQL
- Visualization: Power BI

## Tools Used

- MySQL Workbench
- Power BI Desktop
- GitHub

## Deliverables

- Power BI Dashboard (.pbix)
- Dataset (.csv)
- Dashboard Screenshots
